+3 initiative, +1 strike/parry/dodge, +2 pull punch, +1 roll, +1 save vs magic, +1 vs poison as toxins_poisons, +1 vs psionics, +3 vs horror factor); the other half applies only with a sword and is the Psi-Swordsmanship ability text. +2 disarm is printed separately and stored unconditionally. Physical bonuses +2 P.E., +1D6 Spd, +1D4x10 S.D.C. stored; fatigue at half rate is an ability. || SKILLS: Language and Literacy: Amaki 98 as Language: Amaki 98 + Literacy: Native Language 98 (the Arkhon precedent). One language and literacy of choice at 98% as a choose 1 of Language: Spanish or Language: Other at 98 plus Literacy: Other at 98. Basic Radio (+10%) as Radio: Basic 45+10; Prowl 25+10; Detect Ambush 30+10; Climbing 40+10. W.P. Sword (paired): W.P. Sword plus W.P. Paired Weapons (judgement: the parenthetical and the ''Paired weapons'' line in the bonuses both grant paired use). W.P. Energy Pistol; one W.P. of choice. Hand to Hand: Martial Arts; the book prints no upgrade price, so no hand_to_hand block. In an Amaki pairing Language: Amaki and the two W.P.s are held once. || RELATED: seven other skills plus one additional W.P. stored as count 8 with a floor of one W.P. (minimums). Two more at level 4 and one at 6, 8, 10 and 13. Communications, Domestic, Pilot Related, Science, W.P. and Wilderness any; Electrical Basic Electronics only; Espionage +5; Mechanical Automotive Mechanics only; Medical First Aid or Paramedic only with +5% on First Aid (a per-skill bonus, in the note); Military +5; Physical +10 ''if applicable''; Pilot +5; Rogue +5; Technical +10. || SECONDARY: ''three secondary skills at levels one, five and ten'' read as three at EACH of those levels (count 3, schedule 5 and 10), the same wording ''one at levels six, eight, ten and thirteen'' uses in the related line, and the Sun Priest / Blood Rider reading; same limits without bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: Duelist body armor (duelist-articulated-armor), TW psi-blade, Amaki blast-sword, one energy weapon of choice from a catalog set, 4 E-clips for each as e-clip x8 (the psi-blade runs on I.S.P. and the armor takes none), a set of travel clothes, a set of good clothing (dress-clothing), boots (combat-boots: the plain boots row is Palladium Fantasy), gloves, cape. || MONEY: 2D6x1000 credits. class-check warns that a race stating its own starting_money would win a pairing; the Amaki R.C.C. states none, so with it this figure applies, and the book does not make the Duelist replace its race, so no supersedes_race. || CYBERNETICS: none; a restriction line."
